 contains information about the conference structure. However, the search results don't contain the specific details about:\n\n1. **Review form scoring criteria** - The exact scoring scale and criteria used for reviewer evaluations\n2. **Acceptance rate** - The percentage of papers accepted for CoRL 2025\n\nWhile the results reference Paper Copilot's statistics pages and mention that each paper includes a metrics column showing the review score and citation count from Google Scholar, the actual acceptance rate and detailed scoring criteria for CoRL 2025 were not included in these search results.\n\nFor the most current and detailed information about CoRL 2025's review form scoring criteria and acceptance rate, I recommend:\n- Visiting the official OpenReview page for CoRL 2025\n- Checking the Paper Copilot statistics page for CoRL 2025 (papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2025-statistics)\n- Reviewing the official CoRL conference website\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"808481c6-6a8a-4eae-a76b-0f8df33193a6","uuid":"c71c395e-25ac-4212-a6ba-29cf2a7a2734","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:35:44.170Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2025 review form scoring criteria acceptance rate","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_019MFrycD2ZsYYjpRgdgMejX","content":[{"title":"CORL 2025 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2025-statistics/"},{"title":"CoRL 2025 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2025-paper-list/"},{"title":"CoRL Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/"},{"title":"Cornell University Acceptance Rate 2025","url":"https://www.upgrad.com/study-abroad/university/usa/cornell-university-662/acceptance-rate/"},{"title":"CoRL 2025 Survey - Speaker Deck","url":"https://speakerdeck.com/harukiabe/corl-2025-survey"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2024-paper-list/"},{"title":"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FConference"},{"title":"GitHub - Po-Jen/Robotics-Conference-Acceptance-Rate: Statistics of acceptance rate for the main robotics conference · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/Po-Jen/Robotics-Conference-Acceptance-Rate"},{"title":"CoRL 2023 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2023-statistics/"},{"title":"CoRL 2022 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2022-paper-list/"}]},"Based on the search results, I found some information about CoRL 2025, though the specific details about the review form scoring criteria and acceptance rate were limited in the results. Here's what I found:\n\nThe search results indicate that CoRL 2025 Conference is hosted on OpenReview, which typically contains information about the conference structure. However, the search results don't contain the specific details about:\n\n1. **Review form scoring criteria** - The exact scoring scale and criteria used for reviewer evaluations\n2. **Acceptance rate** - The percentage of papers accepted for CoRL 2025\n\nWhile the results reference Paper Copilot's statistics pages and mention that each paper includes a metrics column showing the review score and citation count from Google Scholar, the actual acceptance rate and detailed scoring criteria for CoRL 2025 were not included in these search results.\n\nFor the most current and detailed information about CoRL 2025's review form scoring criteria and acceptance rate, I recommend:\n- Visiting the official OpenReview page for CoRL 2025\n- Checking the Paper Copilot statistics page for CoRL 2025 (papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2025-statistics)\n-