{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CsNhQPabbw4RMN3qyawWpf","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines review form\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 - Instruction for Authors\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2026%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 - Call for Papers\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/contributions/call-for-papers\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/\"},{\"title\":\"Robot Learning Foundation\",\"url\":\"https://www.robot-learning.org/\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR 2026 Reviewer Guide\",\"url\":\"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2026/ReviewerGuide\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"CVPR 2026 Reviewer Guidelines\",\"url\":\"https://cvpr.thecvf.com/Conferences/2026/ReviewerGuidelinesq\"},{\"title\":\"Instructions for Reviewers\",\"url\":\"https://corl2022.org/instructions-for-reviewers/\"}]\n\nI found information related to CoRL 2026, though the search results don't show a specific dedicated \"CoRL 2026 Reviewer Guidelines\" page with a review form. Here's what I found:\n\n## CoRL 2026 Information\n\nThe search results contain information about CoRL 2026 author instructions and general conference information, but a dedicated reviewer guidelines page specifically for CoRL 2026 doesn't appear to be currently published or readily available through web search.\n\nHowever, I did find:\n\n1. **Author Requirements**: All submissions must include at least one author who agrees to serve as a CoRL reviewer.\n\n2. **Conference Details**: CoRL 2026 will be held November 9-12, 2026 in Austin, Texas, US.