{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PVdkf7J7EMzBVcfaHak272","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-2/projects/importance_margin_vla_compress/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# importance_margin_vla_compress — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 07:54 UTC | 更新原因: Reviewer warning 修正：补 multi-seed 要求，修正 P0 count 和 GPU 预算\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nImportance Margin Maximization (IMM)：直接最大化 VLA visual token 的 importance margin Δ_k，使 token compression 在对抗扰动下具有可证明的 top-k 选择稳定性。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 已通过，2026-05-16）\\\\n- **基础设施**: westd-27271, 2× RTX PRO 6000 96GB\\\\n- **MVP 结果**: G1=93.23x ✅ | G2=+56pp ✅ | G3=0.87x ✅ | G4=0.135 ✅\\\\n- **核心方案**: Two-stage training（Stage1 冻结 backbone 训 ACIS → Stage2 冻结 ACIS 训 LoRA）\\\\n- **Paper framing**: 已写，3 条 Core Claims（provable robustness / lossless-to-gainful compression / denoising effect）\\\\n- **Experiment plan**: 已写，12 个实验（P0: 7 个 ~242 GPU-hrs / P1: 5 个 ~58 GPU-hrs），含 multi-seed\\\\n- **Dream**: dream_20260516T075046 running，full review mode，等回调\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等 Dream 回调 → 根据审稿反馈调整 framing/plan\\\\n- [ ] success rate 评估（plan_001）— sim 环境准备中，cuda:1\\\\n- [ ] v8c_annealing 完成 → 评估（plan_010）— cuda:0\\\\n- [ ] Dream 达标后批准 P0 实验启动\\\\n- [ ] 向 Manager 申请加卡（P0 总量 ~242 GPU-hrs，CoRL 13 天 DDL 需至少 4 张卡）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\nwestd-27271: 2× RTX PRO 6000 96GB。\\\\n- **cuda:0**: v8c_annealing 运行中\\\\n- **cuda:1**: success rate 评估准备中\\\\n- **P0 实验总预算**: ~242 GPU-hrs（含 3-seed 重复）\\\\n- **P1 实验总预算**: ~58 GPU-hrs\\\\n- **需要加卡**：CoRL DDL 前需至少 4 张卡并行\\\\n\\\\n## 投稿时间线\\\\n| Venue | Deadline | 距今 | 可行性 |\\\\n|-------|----------|------|--------|\\\\n| CoRL 2026 | May 29 paper | 13 天 | 极紧，需 4+ 卡并行 + 无失败重跑 |\\\\n| AAAI 2027 | ~Aug 2026 | ~3 月 | 充裕 |\\\\n| ICLR 2027 | ~Oct 2026 | ~5 月 | 全面扩展 |\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D034 | 2026-05-16 | v8b_twostage MVP 全 Gate PASS: G1=93.23x, G2=+56pp, | mvp_imm_v8b_twostage, mvp_imm_anchor_v8, mvp_imm_anchor_v8_1 |\\\\n| D033 | 2026-05-16 | v8.1 (λ=0.2) NEGATIVE: G3=2.53x，降低 λ 反而恶化。根因是低 λ → | mvp_imm_anchor_v8_1, mvp_imm_anchor_v8, mvp_imm_v8b_twostage |\\\\n| D032 | 2026-05-16 | D032: two-stage 简化为 ACIS-only (30K steps, backbone | mvp_imm_v8b_twostage |\\\\n| D031 | 2026-05-16 | D031: 不等 v8.1 结果，立即在 cuda:1 启动 two-stage 训练与 v8.1  | mvp_imm_anchor_v8_1, mvp_imm_v8b_twostage |\\\\n| D030 | 2026-05-16 | D030: Two-stage 确定为 v8.1 FAIL 后首选方向；提前准备代码+dry-run | mvp_imm_anchor_v8, mvp_imm_anchor_v8_1 |\\\\n| D029 | 2026-05-16 | D029: v8 re-eval (fixed) G3=1.344x FAIL 确认；bypass  | mvp_imm_anchor_v8, mvp_baseline_v5, mvp_imm_anchor_v8_1 |\\\\n| D028 | 2026-05-16 | D028 eval bug 确认：evaluate.py 三处 bug 导致所有 pruning 数 | mvp_imm_anchor_v8, mvp_baseline_v5 |\\\\n| D027 | 2026-05-16 | D026 失效：500-batch pruneTrue/baseline=1.456x 推翻 100 | mvp_imm_anchor_v8, mvp_baseline_v5 |\\\\n| D026 | 2026-05-16 | G3 gate 最终定义：主 gate 改为 G3-deploy (PruneTrue/baseli | mvp_imm_anchor_v8, mvp_baseline_v5, mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2 |\\\\n| D025 | 2026-05-16 | G3 gate 重定义：主 gate 改为 G3-deploy (ACIS+Prune/baseli | mvp_imm_anchor_v8, mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2768, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012CQa9smLNftRTpeCXKpL9q","session_id":"808481c6-6a8a-4eae-a76b-0f8df33193a6","uuid":"40c4ba25-15e3-44da-9eec-31c6dd98c31c","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:37:28.394Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01CznF1rYP93WMejJs374zDq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EVbDTyR2NTV2oytn6DSUzU","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"importance_margin_vla_compress","file":"paper_framing.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2141,"cache_read_input_tokens":18154,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2141,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":66,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012CQa9smLNftRTpeCXKpL9q","session_id":"808481c6-6a8a-4eae-a76b-0f8df33193a6","uuid":"707fdb5b-7df9-461b-8d9b-888ad31bd8fc"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EVbDTyR2NTV2oytn6DSUzU","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-2/projects/importance_margin_vla_compress/paper_framing.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Paper Framing — importance_margin_vla_compress\\\\n\\\\n## Target Venue\\\\n- Primary: **CoRL 2026** (Austin, Nov 9-12; abstract May 26, paper May 29 — 13 days, 极紧但 AI 团队可行需加卡)\\\\n- Secondary: **AAAI 2027** (deadline ~August 2026 — 充裕时间做完整实验+理论打磨)\\\\n- Stretch: **ICLR 2027** (deadline ~October 2026 — 全面扩展实验)\\\\n\\\\n## Core Insight\\\\nVLA token compression 的脆弱性根源是 importance ranking instability（margin Δ_k 太小），而非 entropy 问题。直接最大化 Δ_k 既避开了 entropy 方向的文献矛盾，又提供了可证明的 top-k 选择稳定性保证。关键工程发现：ACIS 和 backbone 必须解耦训练（two-stage），否则 co-adaptation 损害 backbone 质量。\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims (3 条，均可证伪)\\\\n\\\\n### Claim 1: Provable Robustness Guarantee\\\\nIMM 训练使 VLA token compression 在 ε-bounded 对抗扰动下具有可证明的 top-k 选择稳定性。形式化保证：P(top-k set changes) ≤ k · ε · L / Δ_k（union bound）。这是首个针对 VLA token compression 的 formal stability condition。\\\\n\\\\n**支撑证据（MVP）**：G1=93.23x margin 提升，G2=+56pp preservation rate 提升，G4=0.135 LED。\\\\n**待补充**：多 ε 水平下的 bound 实证验证、与现有防御方法（adversarial training, smoothing）对比。\\\\n\\\\n### Claim 2: Lossless-to-Gainful Compression via Two-Stage Training\\\\nTwo-stage 训练（Stage1 冻结 backbone 训 ACIS → Stage2 冻结 ACIS 训 LoRA）消除 ACIS-backbone co-adaptation，使 50% token 压缩在保持甚至提升 action prediction 质量的同时提供鲁棒性。（\\\\\\\"lossless-to-gainful\\\\\\\" 待跨 benchmark 验证后可能调整措辞强度）\\\\n\\\\n**支撑证据（MVP）**：G3-deploy=0.87x（优于 baseline 13%），ACIS prune vs random prune = 5.1x。\\\\n**待补充**：跨模型（OpenVLA/OpenPi）、跨 benchmark（LIBERO）验证；success rate 评估；joint vs grad-isolated vs two-stage ablation。\\\\n\\\\n### Claim 3: Importance-Guided Denoising Effect\\\\nACIS 学到的 importance scoring 识别出信息密集的 token 子集，pruning 低重要性 token 起到 denoising/正则化作用，解释了 G3 < 1.0 的现象。\\\\n\\\\n**支撑证据（MVP）**：pruneTrue 0.0035 < baseline 0.0041 < random prune 0.018。\\\\n**待补充**：被删除 token 的 attention weight 分布分析、不同 pruning ratio 下的性能曲线、token importance 与 action relevance 的相关性分析。\\\\n\\\\n## Story Spine\\\\n\\\\n**Problem**: VLA token compression 对实时机器人部署至关重要，但 \\\\\\\"Less Is More Until It Breaks\\\\\\\" (2601.12042) 和 CAGE (ICML 2026) 证明压缩引入了对抗脆弱性——小扰动使压缩机制丢弃安全关键 token。现有 15+ 种 VLA 压缩方法全部只关注效率，无一解决 adversarial robustness。\\\\n\\\\n**Existing approaches & gaps**: 两类工作互不交叉——压缩方法（VLA-ADP, LightVLA, GridS 等）忽略鲁棒性；鲁棒性方法（RobustVLA, ProGAL-VLA）忽略压缩。试图通过 entropy reduction 提升鲁棒性的方向与文献矛盾（ICCV 2023 ADL 和 HIES 证明低 entropy 本身是脆弱性来源）。\\\\n\\\\n**Our framing**: 压缩鲁棒性取决于 importance margin Δ_k，不取决于 entropy。我们直接最大化 Δ_k，提供首个 certified condition for safe VLA token compression。关键工程贡献：two-stage 训练解耦 ACIS 与 backbone，消除 co-adaptation 使压缩无损甚至增益。\\\\n\\\\n**Headline result template**: \\\\\\\"On {benchmark}, IMM-trained SmolVLA achieves {X}% task success rate under 50% token compression + ε={Y} perturbation, while standard compression retains only {Z}% success rate, providing the first formal stability guarantee for VLA token compression.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n**核心指标**: Success rate（用户要求）。Action loss 为辅助指标，用于分析但不作为 headline。\\\\n\\\\n## Venue Fit Risks\\\\n\\\\n- **CoRL**: 理想匹配（VLA + robotics deployment + robustness）。风险：理论贡献需要包装为\\\\\\\"deployability criterion\\\\\\\"而非纯 adversarial ML。时间极紧（13 天），需要加 GPU 并行铺实验。\\\\n- **AAAI**: 接受理论+实验混合贡献。风险：robotics 社区 overlap 较小，需要强调通用 token compression 安全性。\\\\n- **ICLR**: 最匹配理论+方法贡献。风险：需要更全面的 baseline 对比和 ablation。\\\\n\\\\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Response Plan\\\\n\\\\n### RC1: G3 < 1.0 为什么压缩后更好？\\\\n**应对**：Claim 3 的 ablation（attention weight 分析、pruning ratio 曲线、token importance-action 相关性）。预期审稿人会怀疑这是 evaluation artifact。\\\\n\\\\n### RC2: 只在 SmolVLA/aloha_sim_insertion 上验证\\\\n**应对**：扩展到 OpenVLA + LIBERO suite。至少 2 个模型 × 2 个 benchmark。\\\\n\\\\n### RC3: 只有 action loss 没有 success rate\\\\n**应对**：已在准备 sim rollout 评估。成功率是最终判据。\\\\n\\\\n### RC4: ACIS hard dependency（standard ratio 5.09x）\\\\n**应对**：这是 feature not bug——ACIS 是 deployment 时的必要组件（类似 BatchNorm），部署成本可忽略（lightweight cross-attention）。论文需讨论 deployment overhead。\\\\n\\\\n### RC5: Formal bound 实证验证\\\\n**应对**：多 ε 水平下测量 bound tightness，绘制 theoretical vs empirical 对比图。\\\\n\\\\n### RC6: 与现有压缩方法的 head-to-head 对比\\\\n**应对**：IMM 是 compression-agnostic 的训练方法，可叠加到任何 compression method 上。实验需展示 IMM + FastV、IMM + VLA-IAP、IMM + VLA-Cache 的组合效果。\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3803, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012CQa9smLNftRTpeCXKpL9q","session_id":"808481c6-6a8a-4eae-a76b-0f8df33193a6","uuid":"40b787c3-00c7-488e-a11d-1faec55b6a46","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:37:34.130Z"}
