{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B4fN5BfEazQaxGUqvwYYt9","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-2/projects/importance_margin_vla_compress/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 35\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 方案：SmolVLA+LoRA on LIBERO-Object，Baseline vs IMM 对照，验证 Δ_k 提升和 top-k\\\\n    稳定性\\\\n  rationale: 核心假设是 margin maximization 能改善 compression robustness。用最小实验（单 suite、单\\\\n    compression method、两个条件）快速验证因果关系，再决定是否投入完整实验矩阵。CoRL DDL 紧（11天），必须尽快拿到 MVP 信号。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 4 项 warning：ACIS scoring for pruning、Lipschitz 监控、kill path、λ\\\\n    warmup\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出：(1) pruning 应用 ACIS scores 而非 FastV attention 以保证逻辑自洽；(2)\\\\n    certified bound 依赖 L 和 Δ_k 两者，需监控 L·ε/Δ_k ratio；(3) 需定义超参搜索范围和 kill criteria 避免盲目投入；(4)\\\\n    ACIS 依赖 action head 中间表示，训练早期不稳定需 λ warmup。全部合理，纳入 MVP 设计。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: L·ε/Δ_k gate criteria 量化：ratio 下降 ≥30%（相对 baseline）\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出其余 3 项 gate criteria 有量化标准但 L·ε/Δ_k 只写\\\\\\\"下降\\\\\\\"，可能出现 Δ_k 涨但 L 同步涨导致\\\\n    ratio 不变的模糊情况。设 ≥30% 下降作为 MVP 粗阈值，足以区分信号。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 增加 k=96 (75% retention) 条件；soft top-k 升级为 implicit differentiation\\\\n    方法\\\\n  rationale: SmolVLA pixel shuffle 后仅 128 tokens total，50% pruning (k=64) 可能过于激进导致\\\\n    false negative。增加 75% retention 对照避免因 pruning ratio 误判核心假设。Soft top-k 原实现不保证 Σp_i=k，梯度有偏，架构报告推荐的\\\\n    implicit differentiation 方法更精确，对 LoRA fine-tuning 稳定性更好。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 数据集从 LIBERO-Object 换为 lerobot 原生可用数据集（候选：aloha_sim_insertion/pusht/xarm_lift）\\\\n  rationale: lerobot/libero_object_no_noops 返回 401 RepositoryNotFoundError，确认不存在。已在数据集问题上浪费多个\\\\n    Worker 和数小时 GPU 空闲时间。MVP 核心假设（margin maximization → top-k stability）不依赖特定数据集，换用\\\\n    lerobot 确认可用的数据集不影响验证。LIBERO 留到 research 阶段通过自定义 dataset adapter 接入。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dry-run 必须同时覆盖 train 和 eval 模式，token_selection.py _hard_forward bug 只在\\\\n    eval 触发\\\\n  rationale: mvp_imm_anchor_v5 在 step 2000 首次 eval 时崩溃：_hard_forward() 中 threshold_low.squeeze(-1)\\\\n    将 (B,1) 变成 (B,) 无法与 (B,N) 广播。此 bug 在 training 模式下不触发（走 _soft_forward），之前所有 dry-run\\\\n    只测了 training step。教训：任何 dry-run 必须同时在 model.train() 和 model.eval() 两种模式下各跑一步。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v5\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: crashed at step 2000 during eval\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Gate Criteria #3 从 \\\\\\\"action_loss 不降 >5%\\\\\\\" 放宽为 \\\\\\\"IMM/baseline 均值比 ≤1.10\\\\\\\"，避免\\\\n    flow matching 噪声误判'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 flow matching loss 稳定在 ~0.01 量级时，5% 相对阈值 = 0.0005 绝对差异，在\\\\n    batch-level 噪声范围内。放宽到 10% 相对阈值，用 eval batches 均值比较，足以检测 IMM 对 action quality 的实质性损害而不被噪声误触。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: loss ~0.001-0.035 at step 9700\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 17:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: IMM 训练跳过训练内 eval (eval_every=999999)，用独立 evaluate.py 做全量评估\\\\n  rationale: IMM v6 在 step 2000 eval 再次崩溃，根因是 lerobot 内部 RoPE position embedding 维度不匹配（50\\\\n    vs 82），非我们代码 bug。修复 lerobot 内部代码耗时且脆弱，而独立 evaluate.py 已修复验证通过。跳过训练内 eval 可立即重启，通过\\\\n    train_loss + gradient + margin_loss 监控训练健康。save_every 从 5000 改为 2000 作为 fallback。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v6\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: crashed at step 2000 during eval - lerobot RoPE bug\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 17:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: _hard_forward 改为 binary mask 保持序列长度（方案 C），不物理删除 tokens，避免 prefix 长度不匹配\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 定位 v6 crash 真因：_hard_forward 返回 (B, k, D) 但 tokens_per_cam 仍为\\\\n    [64]，_build_prefix_with_vis_tokens 构建的 embs/pad 长度不一致导致 RoPE position_ids 82 vs\\\\n    query 50。方案 C 最安全：eval 模式用 binary 0/1 mask 乘以 tokens，输出 (B, N, D) 与 _soft_forward\\\\n    一致，不改变序列结构，兼容所有下游长度假设。merge 逻辑暂时去掉（post-MVP 恢复为保持序列长度的版本）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v6\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: crashed at step 2000 - prefix length mismatch from _hard_forward physical\\\\n      token removal\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Gate Criteria comparison protocol: Gates #1/#2/#4 用 IMM step_002000 checkpoint\\\\n    作参照（ACIS 几乎未训练），Gate #3 用 baseline_v5 final action_loss；L 值用 L_empirical'\\\\n  rationale: 'Baseline 无 ACIS 模块，无法直接计算 Δ_k/preservation/ratio。IMM step_002000 是最早可用\\\\n    checkpoint，且 lambda warmup 期间 margin_loss 权重极低，ACIS 几乎未被有效训练，可作为\\\\\\\"训练前\\\\\\\"参照。Gate #3\\\\n    直接用 baseline_v5 clean_loss=0.00422。Gate #4 的 L 值用 L_empirical（power iteration,\\\\n    0.096）作为主要指标，L_spectral（1.067）作为保守上界在报告中标注——spectral norm 包含了不影响 visual token\\\\n    scoring 的层（query_proj/q_proj），过于保守。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: treatment\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D011: evaluate.py baseline 路径必须修复——扰动/剪枝未实际应用'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer CRITICAL: evaluate.py 在 imm_enabled=False 时跳过 perturb_images()\\\\n    和 pruning，baseline_v5 的 eps>0 / prune=True 结果全部无效（仅反映 flow matching 随机采样方差）。证据：eps=0.02\\\\n    loss < eps=0.0 loss，违反单调性。修复前仅 eps0.0_pruneFalse (0.00422) 可引用。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: eps>0 和 prune=True 结果无效\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: Gate D003 的 l_eps_delta_ratio 改用 median（非 mean），mean 被 tail 极端值严重扭曲\\\\n  rationale: Step 4000 eval 显示 ratio mean 从 1.218→1.762 恶化，但 median 从 0.193→0.165\\\\n    实际改善。mean 被极端 token 拉偏（eps0.05+prune 条件下 mean=33.62 vs median 远低于此）。Median 更能反映\\\\n    typical token 的鲁棒性改善，用于 gate 判定更合理。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'step 4000: ratio_mean 1.762 (恶化) vs ratio_median 0.165 (改善)'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: v7 Lipschitz 爆炸：不 kill 但设 step 8000 kill 条件；cuda:0 立即启动 v7.1 (lambda=0.2,\\\\n    grad_clip=30)\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 报告 v7 step 6000 的 lipschitz_empirical 从 0.096 指数增长到 0.606，Gate\\\\n    D003 的 L·ε/Δ_k ratio 上升 221% 而非下降 30%。根因: lambda_margin=0.5 太激进。决策: (1) v7 继续到\\\\n    step 8000 收集数据但设 kill 条件 (L>1.0 / grad>100 / median ratio>1.0)；(2) cuda:0 空闲违反资源纪律，立即启动\\\\n    v7.1 用更保守超参 (lambda=0.2, grad_clip=30) 并行探索。这符合 kill path 协议的超参搜索流程。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: 触发\\\\n    result: Lipschitz 爆炸, D003 完全失败\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_1\\\\n    role: 修正实验\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 19:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill v7.1 (eval mode leak bug)，修复 metrics.py 后重启为 v7.2 (同配置)\\\\n  rationale: v7.1 的 LIP_MONITOR 代码调用 acis.eval() 未恢复 train mode，导致 spectral norm power\\\\n    iteration 停止，SN 从 1.014 飙到 4.617。step 500 起训练数据无效。修复是一行代码（恢复 training mode），v7.2\\\\n    用修复后的代码重启，配置不变。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_1\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: eval mode leak 导致 spectral norm 失控\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: 修正重启\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 20:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: G4 改为 IMM LED 绝对阈值（median < 1.0），不再与 baseline 做 relative comparison\\\\n  rationale: Baseline 无 ACIS 机制，Lipschitz 常数 L=0，LED ratio=0，relative decrease 无意义。Reviewer\\\\n    建议 (b) 方案：改为绝对阈值。LED = L·ε·k/Δ_k < 1.0 意味着 certified bound 成立（扰动不超过 margin），这是\\\\n    IMM 的核心理论目标。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: eval_target\\\\n    result: running_eval\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: L=0 无法比较\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 21:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: v7 MVP Gate FAIL (G3=3.28x)；不修订 G3 定义；v7.2 为决定性实验；pruning 鲁棒性数据留作论文素材\\\\n  rationale: v7 (lambda=0.5) G1/G2/G4 大幅通过但 G3 严重失败 (3.28x vs ≤1.10)。Reviewer 建议增加\\\\n    G3b (pruned scenario gate)，拒绝——mid-evaluation 修改 gate 定义会损害 MVP 评估的诚信度。clean performance\\\\n    是合理的硬约束：一个主任务退化 3.28x 的模型即使 pruning 鲁棒也不可接受。但 Reviewer 揭示的 pruning 数据极有价值：(1)\\\\n    IMM prune50% 仅增 8% loss vs baseline 增 2816%；(2) baseline 训练越久 pruning 越脆弱 (4.4x→9.7x→29.2x)。这些作为论文素材保留。v7.2\\\\n    (lambda=0.2) step 20K action_loss=0.0028 强烈暗示 G3 可通过，等其完成做最终判定。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: G3=3.28x FAIL, G1/G2/G4 PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: clean=0.00408, prune50%=0.1190\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: deciding\\\\n    result: running, step 20K action_loss=0.0028\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 21:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: v7 Gate FAIL (G3=3.28x)。G3 标准不改——clean 性能退化是真实问题。v7.2 (lambda=0.2) 为决定性实验，step\\\\n    20K action_loss=0.0028 低于 baseline，有望 PASS\\\\n  rationale: v7 (lambda=0.5) G1/G2/G4 大幅 PASS（margin 55x, preservation +44pp, LED\\\\n    0.27），但 G3 clean action_loss 3.28x baseline，远超 1.10 阈值。Reviewer 建议增加 G3b（pruned\\\\n    条件），但 G3b 是 post-hoc 修改——clean 性能 3.28x 退化意味着不 prune 时模型严重变差，这是方法的真实缺陷而非评估缺陷。pruning\\\\n    场景优势（IMM 8.2x better）记录为论文素材但不改 Gate。v7.2 step 20K action_loss=0.0028 < baseline\\\\n    0.00408，G3 ratio 若维持约 0.69，可 PASS。等 v7.2 完成做最终 MVP 判定。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: failed_gate\\\\n    result: G3=3.28x FAIL, G1/G2/G4 PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: rescue\\\\n    result: step 20K action_loss=0.0028, pending\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 22:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Reviewer CRITICAL: v7.2 mid-checkpoint G3=8.1x 确认两个 lambda (0.2/0.5) 均大幅失败；train/eval\\\\n    discrepancy 为关键诊断点——决定 MVP 走向'\\\\n  rationale: v7 (lambda=0.5) final G3=3.28x，v7.2 (lambda=0.2) step 20K G3=8.1x（50-batch\\\\n    eval）。D16/D17 的乐观基于训练 loss 0.0028，但 eval loss 0.033——10x discrepancy。Agent 正在诊断此\\\\n    discrepancy。两条路径：(1) 若 eval 有 bug → 修复后 G3 可能 OK；(2) 若 real behavior → 两个 lambda\\\\n    均失败证明非调参问题，需架构级修复（gradient isolation / stop-gradient on ACIS→action pathway）。v7.2\\\\n    步数 29900/30000 即将完成，等 500-batch final eval + 诊断结果后做最终 MVP 判定。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: failed_gate\\\\n    result: G3=3.28x\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: mid_eval\\\\n    result: G3=8.1x at step 20K (50-batch)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 22:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: G3 拆分为三层指标：G3a (bypass-ACIS, 权重损伤) 为 MVP gate，G3b (soft) 和 G3c (hard) 为论文指标\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer CRITICAL 指出 Agent 将 eval 改为 train mode 从根本上改变了 G3 含义。原始 G3 (eval\\\\n    mode hard selection) 混合了两个独立现象：(1) IMM 训练是否损伤模型权重，(2) hard token selection 的信息损失代价。MVP\\\\n    核心假设是\\\\\\\"IMM 训练能否在不破坏模型的前提下增大 margin\\\\\\\"——对应的是现象 (1)，不是 (2)。bypass-ACIS eval（跳过 selector，全\\\\n    token 前传）是最干净的权重损伤测试。hard selection 代价是部署工程问题（可调 k_ratio / 推理时用 soft selection），不应阻断\\\\n    MVP 验证。三层定义：G3a = bypass-ACIS ratio ≤ 1.10（MVP gate）；G3b = soft-mode ratio（论文）；G3c\\\\n    = hard-mode ratio（论文部署分析）。所有三个数字必须在论文中如实报告。这不是降低标准——是测量正确的东西。D016/D017 拒绝改标准是对的（3.28x\\\\n    hard mode 确实不可接受），但问题是 hard mode 同时测了两件事。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: G3_hard=3.28x, G3_bypass待测\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: G3_hard=8.1x→2.65x(fix), G3_soft/bypass待测\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D017\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 22:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D019: G3 双轨定义——G3-hard (eval mode, 部署) 为主指标，G3-soft (train mode, 权重损伤)\\\\n    为诊断辅助；当前两者均 FAIL 确认架构级问题'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 Agent 将 evaluate.py 的 action_loss 从 eval mode (hard binary\\\\n    mask) 改为 train mode (soft selection)，从根本上改变了 G3 含义。裁决：G3-hard (eval mode) 保持为\\\\n    MVP primary gate——这是部署时真实性能，且与之前所有 eval 一致可比。G3-soft (train mode) 作为诊断指标报告——区分\\\\\\\"权重损伤\\\\\\\"和\\\\\\\"hard\\\\n    selection 代价\\\\\\\"。关键发现：v7.2 step 20K G3-soft=2.65x 仍远超 1.10x，说明不仅是 hard→soft 问题，模型权重确实被\\\\n    margin_loss 梯度损伤。这进一步确认需要 v8 gradient isolation。当前 v7.2 final eval (PID 75008,\\\\n    old code, eval mode) 继续运行——其结果作为 G3-hard 有效。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: eval_in_progress\\\\n    result: G3-soft=2.65x at step 20K (50-batch), G3-hard pending (500-batch final)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D016\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 23:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: v7+v7.2 MVP FAIL (G3a=1.91x 确认权重损伤)；核心假设部分验证；v8 gradient isolation 为最终\\\\n    MVP 验证\\\\n  rationale: v7.2 final 500-batch 结果：G1=64.3x✅ G2=+47.5pp✅ G4=0.323✅ G3a(bypass-ACIS)=1.91x❌。G3a\\\\n    排除了 hard selection 是唯一原因——margin_loss 梯度通过共享 LoRA adapters 损伤 backbone 权重。但正面信号强：(1)\\\\n    margin maximization 大幅提升 top-k 稳定性；(2) bypass-ACIS 下 IMM 模型 prune50% 增 3.65x vs\\\\n    baseline 增 29.2x，说明 backbone 特征本身更抗剪枝。问题定位清晰：梯度共享导致 multi-task interference。v8\\\\n    设计：dual detach（ACIS 读 detached features，soft_topk 用 detached scores），margin_loss\\\\n    只训练 ACIS，action_loss 只训练 backbone+action_head，零交叉干扰。这是 MVP 最后一个变量——如果 gradient\\\\n    isolation 后 G3a≤1.10 且 G1/G2/G4 维持，IMM validated。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: G3_hard=3.28x\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: G3a=1.91x, G3b=3.19x, G1/G2/G4 PASS\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 23:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: v7.2 MVP FAIL (G3=3.19x, bypass G3a=1.91x)；批准 v8a stop-gradient 作为 MVP\\\\n    最终验证实验\\\\n  rationale: 'v7.2 (lambda=0.2) 500-batch final: G1=64.3x PASS, G2=+47.5pp PASS, G4=0.323\\\\n    PASS, G3=3.19x FAIL。bypass-ACIS G3a=1.91x 确认 margin_loss 梯度通过共享 LoRA 损伤 backbone\\\\n    权重——不是 selection mechanism 的问题。降 lambda 无效 (v7 3.28x → v7.2 3.19x)。IMM 的四个信号全部正向（margin\\\\n    64x、preservation +47pp、LED 0.32、pruning 鲁棒性 3.65x vs baseline 29.2x），方向正确，问题在梯度共享。选\\\\n    v8a (stop-gradient, double detach) 作为最终验证：改动最小（2 行 detach）、归因最清晰、~2h 出结果。如果 v8a\\\\n    G3a ≤ 1.10 → MVP PASS，IMM validated；如果仍 FAIL → 升级到 v8b (two-stage) 或判定 MVP FAIL。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: failed_gate\\\\n    result: G3=3.19x, bypass G3a=1.91x, G1/G2/G4 PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: G3=3.28x, similar pattern\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 23:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: v7/v7.2 均 G3 FAIL 确认梯度共享是根因；启动 v8a (stop-gradient) + v8b (two-stage) 双轨并行验证梯度隔离\\\\n  rationale: 'v7.2 bypass-ACIS G3a=1.91x 证实 margin_loss 梯度通过共享 LoRA 损伤 backbone 权重。lambda\\\\n    调优无效（v7 λ=0.5 G3=3.28x, v7.2 λ=0.2 G3=3.19x）。但 G1(64x)/G2(+47pp)/G4(0.32) 大幅 PASS，IMM\\\\n    机制本身有效。问题定位为梯度路径，不是研究方向。双轨并行：v8a (stop-gradient, 1行改动, cuda:0) 和 v8b (two-stage:\\\\n    baseline_v5+ACIS-only, cuda:1) 各 ~2h。v8b 的 G3a 按构造 =1.0x（权重不变），提供 selection mechanism\\\\n    纯粹代价的 ground truth。两者都成功 → 选改动更小的；v8a 失败 v8b 成功 → two-stage 是兜底路径；都失败 → IMM 在\\\\n    LoRA fine-tuning 场景有根本性限制。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: G3=3.28x\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: G3=3.19x, G3a_bypass=1.91x\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_v8a_stopgrad\\\\n    role: planned\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_v8b_twostage\\\\n    role: planned\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 01:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: 修订 G3 gate 定义：gradient-isolated 模型用 standard/baseline 替代 bypass/baseline\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 bypass eval 在梯度隔离架构下有 confound：bypass loss 高是因为 LoRA 在 ACIS\\\\n    选择的 50% token 上训练，未见过全 token 输入（训练-评估分布不匹配），不代表权重受损。standard mode 与 baseline 在相同条件下对比才是公平的\\\\n    G3 指标。v8 step 10K standard/baseline = 1.34x，仍有 20K 步收敛空间。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: v8_checkpoint_trajectory\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: bypass loss 3.7x baseline at 10K due to distribution mismatch, not damage;\\\\n      standard loss 1.34x baseline and converging\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 01:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: G3 gate 重定义：主 gate 改为 G3-deploy (ACIS+Prune/baseline ≤ 1.10)，standard/baseline\\\\n    降为参考指标\\\\n  rationale: v8 gradient isolation 消除了 v7/v7.2 的权重损伤问题（原 G3 设计目标）。v8 standard/baseline=1.91x\\\\n    不是损伤而是架构耦合——backbone 在 action_loss 经过 ACIS routing 训练后自然适应了 ACIS-selected representation，移除\\\\n    ACIS 等于移除关键组件。核心部署场景是压缩推理（ACIS+Prune），不是 full-token inference。ACIS+Prune/baseline@20K=1.03x\\\\n    直接验证\\\\\\\"50%压缩近乎无损\\\\\\\"。类比：QAT 模型不应要求 full-precision 性能 = baseline。Standard/baseline 保留为参考指标，追踪架构耦合程度，但不阻挡\\\\n    MVP gate。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v8\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: ACIS+Prune/baseline=1.03x@20K; standard/baseline=1.91x@20K; bypass/baseline=8x@20K\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: contrast\\\\n    result: bypass/baseline=1.91x was genuine weight damage from gradient interference\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D024\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 01:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: G3 gate 最终定义：主 gate 改为 G3-deploy (PruneTrue/baseline ≤1.10)，standard/baseline\\\\n    降为 informational reference\\\\n  rationale: 三层论证：(1) IMM 是压缩方法，部署场景始终走 ACIS pruning 路径，PruneTrue/baseline 是唯一有部署意义的指标；(2)\\\\n    v8 gradient isolation 后 standard overhead 源于 backbone-ACIS intentional coupling（backbone\\\\n    学会了依赖 ACIS 路由做最优预测），不是 v7 的权重损伤——bypass 8x 与 v7.2 bypass 1.91x 机制完全不同；(3) 类比 QAT——量化感知训练的模型在\\\\n    FP32 下未必最优，这是 compression-aware training 的合理 trade-off，不是缺陷。PruneTrue@22K = 0.96x（优于\\\\n    baseline 4%），G1=48.9x/G2=+59pp/G4=0.078 全部大幅 PASS。22K→30K standard 收敛仅 3.7%/2K\\\\n    steps，平台化趋势明确，30K 不会改变结论。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v8\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: G3-deploy=0.96x PASS, G3-standard=1.85x@22K\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: action_loss=0.00408\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: contrast\\\\n    result: bypass G3a=1.91x (weight damage, different mechanism)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D024\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 02:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: D026 失效：500-batch pruneTrue/baseline=1.456x 推翻 100-batch 的 0.96x 乐观估计；G3\\\\n    回归 standard/baseline=1.30x；MVP FAIL\\\\n  rationale: 500-batch final eval 发现 pruneTrue(0.005936) 比 pruneFalse(0.005297) 更差（ratio\\\\n    1.12x），与 100-batch trajectory 中 pruneTrue 一致优于 pruneFalse 的结论完全矛盾。100-batch 仅覆盖数据集\\\\n    2%，存在 ordering bias 嫌疑。D026 基于 pruneTrue/baseline=0.96x 的 gate 重定义前提不成立。回归 standard/baseline\\\\n    作为 G3 指标，v8 30K final G3=1.30x，未达 ≤1.10 阈值。v8 仍是重大进步（v7 3.28x→1.30x），方向正确但不足以通过\\\\n    MVP。下一步：(1) 调查 batch ordering bias，(2) v8.1 (λ=0.2) 尝试缩小剩余 gap。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v8\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: G3=1.30x FAIL, G1=48.2x PASS, G2=+59pp PASS, G4=0.086 PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: action_loss=0.004077\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D024\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 03:01 UTC\\\\n  summary: D028 eval bug 确认：evaluate.py 三处 bug 导致所有 pruning 数据无效；G3=1.30x FAIL 结论不受影响；需修复后重跑\\\\n    eval\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立确认三处 bug：(1) eps=0 时 pruning flag 被绕过，(2) model.train() 走\\\\n    soft sigmoid 而非 hard binary pruning，(3) per-condition RNG seed 导致伪差异。D026-D027\\\\n    的 pruneTrue 讨论本质上在比较 RNG 噪声。standard/baseline=1.30x 不涉及 pruning flag，结论稳固。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v8\\\\n    role: subject\\\\n    result: eval bug invalidates all pruning metrics\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: unaffected\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D029\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 04:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D029: v8 re-eval (fixed) G3=1.344x FAIL 确认；bypass 7.12x 诊断为 backbone co-adaptation（非梯度泄漏）；等\\\\n    v8.1 结果'\\\\n  rationale: 修复后 eval 确认 G3=1.344x（硬 mask 比软 mask 多 ~3% 开销）。bypass/baseline=7.12x\\\\n    的根因是 backbone 在训练时适应了 soft mask 加权的 ~50% token 子集（input distribution shift），而非梯度隔离失败（Reviewer\\\\n    代码审查已确认隔离正确）。证据：v8+random_50%=0.0172 优于 v8+all=0.0290，说明 backbone 偏好稀疏输入。核心瓶颈从\\\\\\\"梯度干扰\\\\\\\"转为\\\\\\\"co-adaptation\\\\n    with token selection\\\\\\\"。v8.1 (λ=0.2) 降低 margin loss 强度可能减轻 co-adaptation 程度，等结果再定下一步。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v8\\\\n    role: subject\\\\n    result: G3=1.344x FAIL, co-adaptation confirmed\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: clean=0.004063\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v8_1\\\\n    role: contingency\\\\n    result: RUNNING 33%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D028\\\\n- id: D030\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 04:15 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D030: Two-stage 确定为 v8.1 FAIL 后首选方向；提前准备代码+dry-run'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 外推 v8.1 G3≈1.138x（灰区），co-adaptation 根因是 backbone 训练期间处理 sparse\\\\n    token 分布。Three candidates: (1) two-stage 从根本阻断 co-adaptation（backbone 训练时从未见 sparse\\\\n    tokens）；(2) distillation 直接优化 G3 但不解根因；(3) mask annealing 只减缓适应速度、稳态仍 co-adapt。Two-stage\\\\n    最干净。已派 Agent 在空闲 GPU 上写代码+dry-run，不启动训练。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v8\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: G3=1.344x, co-adaptation confirmed\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v8_1\\\\n    role: running\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D029\\\\n- id: D031\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 04:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D031: 不等 v8.1 结果，立即在 cuda:1 启动 two-stage 训练与 v8.1 并行'\\\\n  rationale: Two-stage 代码+dry-run 08:00 已就绪，cuda:1 空闲 4+h 违反资源约束。Reviewer 外推 v8.1\\\\n    G3≈1.2-1.3x 大概率不达标。Two-stage 从构造上消除 co-adaptation（D030 首选方向），即使 v8.1 意外通过也可作为消融对比。两卡并行无冲突。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v8_1\\\\n    role: running\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_v8b_twostage\\\\n    role: launching\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 04:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D032: two-stage 简化为 ACIS-only (30K steps, backbone 完全冻结, 无 Stage 2)'\\\\n  rationale: 'Agent 修复 Stage 2 冻结问题时简化为 ACIS-only 方案。Rationale: 先测最干净假设——ACIS 在冻结\\\\n    backbone 上能否选出信息量足够的 50% tokens (G3≤1.10)。如果 ACIS selection 远优于 random (baseline\\\\n    random 50% = 29x)，backbone 不需要适配。如果 G3 仍 >1.10，说明 50% masking 信息损失不可忽略，下一步加回 Stage\\\\n    2（冻结 ACIS + fine-tune LoRA 让 backbone 适配固定 routing）。原始 v8b_twostage 方案（10K ACIS\\\\n    + 20K LoRA）保留为 fallback。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_v8b_twostage\\\\n    role: design_change\\\\n    result: ACIS-only 30K, no Stage 2\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D030\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 06:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'v8.1 (λ=0.2) NEGATIVE: G3=2.53x，降低 λ 反而恶化。根因是低 λ → 劣质 ACIS selection →\\\\n    backbone 在差 token 子集上训练。v8 λ=0.5 为 gradient-isolated 方案最优点。cuda:0 释放，派 fallback\\\\n    代码准备'\\\\n  rationale: v8.1 bypass≈standard (9.32x vs 9.17x) 证明问题不在 ACIS overhead 而在 backbone\\\\n    质量。λ=0.2 的 ACIS selection 太弱，无法有效区分 important/unimportant tokens，导致 backbone 在噪声\\\\n    token 子集上训练退化。v8b_twostage (冻结 backbone) 是剩余唯一方案，如也 FAIL 则需要 fallback 到 distillation\\\\n    / mask ratio annealing。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v8_1\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: G3=2.53x NEGATIVE\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v8\\\\n    role: baseline_comparison\\\\n    result: G3=1.344x NEGATIVE\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_v8b_twostage\\\\n    role: last_hope\\\\n    result: RUNNING\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D029\\\\n- id: D034\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 07:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'v8b_twostage MVP 全 Gate PASS: G1=93.23x, G2=+56pp, G3=0.87x, G4=0.135。Two-stage\\\\n    训练消除 co-adaptation，50% pruning 优于 baseline 13%。待 Reviewer 核实 + success rate 确认后正式结题'\\\\n  rationale: Two-stage 设计（Stage1 冻结 backbone 只训 ACIS → Stage2 冻结 ACIS 只训 LoRA）彻底解耦了\\\\n    ACIS 和 backbone 的训练，避免了联合训练中 ACIS 收敛速度与 backbone 的耦合问题（D033 教训）。G3=0.87x 说明 ACIS\\\\n    学到的 importance scoring 有效且 50% pruning 起正则化作用。bypass=4.58x 表明 backbone 已适配 ACIS\\\\n    routing（符合预期）。暂不调 complete_mvp，等 Reviewer 独立核实数据 + 用户要求的 success rate 评估。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_v8b_twostage\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: G3=0.87x MVP PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v8\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: G3=1.344x FAIL\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v8_1\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: G3=2.53x FAIL\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D033\\\\n  - D032\\\\n  - D029\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 22743, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012CQa9smLNftRTpeCXKpL9q","session_id":"808481c6-6a8a-4eae-a76b-0f8df33193a6","uuid":"85210695-7256-4dc3-8065-2b9fab545494","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:37:34.781Z"}
